false,"sensitiveInformation":2,"abstract":"An experimental and theoretical program on cylindrical and spherical premixed flames in microgravity has been initiated. We are especially interested in: (1) assessing heat loss versus flow divergence as the dominant stabilization mechanism; (2) understanding the effects of flame curvature on the burning intensity; and (3) determining the laminar burning velocity by using this configuration. In the present study we have performed analytical, computational, and mu g-experimental investigations of the cylindrical flame. The results are presented.","isLessonsLearned":false,"disseminated":"DOCUMENT_AND_METADATA","publications":[{"submissionId":19960008450,"id":"3756c97844ad4ccb9f9d5745805ea510","publicationName":"NASA. Lewis Research Center, The 3rd International Microgravity Combustion Workshop","publicationDate":"1995-08-01T00:00:00.0000000+00:00"}],"status":"CURATED","related":[{"disseminated":"DOCUMENT_AND_METADATA","id":19960008386,"type":"ANALYTIC_PRIMARY","title":"The 3rd International Microgravity Combustion Workshop","stiType":"CONFERENCE_PROCEEDINGS","distribution":"PUBLIC","status":"CURATED"},{"disseminated":"DOCUMENT_AND_METADATA","id":19960008386,"type":"ANALYTIC_PRIMARY","title":"The 3rd International Microgravity Combustion Workshop","stiType":"CONFERENCE_PROCEEDINGS","distribution":"PUBLIC","accessionNumber":"N96-15553 through N96-15622","status":"CURATED"}],"downloads":[{"draft":false,"mimetype":"application/pdf","name":"19960008450.pdf","type":"STI","links":{"original":"/api/citations/19960008450/downloads/19960008450.pdf","pdf":"/api/citations/19960008450/downloads/19960008450.pdf","fulltext":"/api/citations/19960008450/downloads/19960008450.txt"}}],"downloadsAvailable":true,"index":"submissions-2026-11-12-06-24"},{"_meta":{"score":107.98004},"copyright":{"thirdPartyPermissionsProduced":false,"disclosedToPublic":false,"containsIndication":false,"publisherPermissionOrRightsToDistribute":false,"belongsToUsGov":